{"text": "The next two hours flew by on rosy wings. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Della searched every store in town for Jims present. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At last she found it, and it surely had been made for Jim and no one else. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was a platinum chain for his watch, simple and plain in design. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was like Jim himself, quiet and valuable. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She paid twenty one dollars for it and hurried home with the eighty seven cents. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With that chain on his watch, Jim could check the time proudly in any company. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Grand as the watch was, he sometimes looked at it secretly because of the old leather strap he used instead of a chain. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When Della reached home, she got out her curling irons and went to work. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Within forty minutes her head was covered with tiny, close lying curls. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She looked at herself in the mirror long and carefully. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Jim will say I look like a schoolboy, she worried.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "n", "e", "x", "t", " ", "t", "w", "o", " ", "h", "o", "u", "r", "s", " ", "f", "l", "e", "w", " ", "b", "y", " ", "o", "n", " ", "r", "o", "s", "y", " ", "w", "i", "n", "g", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "D", "e", "l", "l", "a", " ", "s", "e", "a", "r", "c", "h", "e", "d", " ", "e", "v", "e", "r", "y", " ", "s", "t", "o", "r", "e", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "o", "w", "n", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "J", "i", "m", "s", " ", "p", "r", "e", "s", "e", "n", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "t", " ", "l", "a", "s", "t", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "f", "o", "u", "n", "d", " ", "i", "t", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "i", "t", " ", "s", "u", "r", "e", "l", "y", " ", "h